  "date": "October 2026",
  "abstract": "Covers the Machine Payments Protocol (MPP) by Tempo and Stripe: the \"Payment\" HTTP authentication scheme of draft-httpauth-payment-01 (402 challenges in WWW-Authenticate, HMAC challenge binding over JCS-serialized requests, credentials in Authorization or Payment-Authorization, Payment-Receipt, Accept-Payment, RFC 9457 problem types and 402/401/403 semantics), the charge and subscription intents, method-defined session intents, OpenAPI discovery with x-payment-info, the JSON-RPC and MCP transport, reconciliation and security. It lists one version line, draft-httpauth-payment-01 (current, posture build), with the companion documents pinned to paymentauth.org at mpp-specs commit 50309c8. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out versions, the core protocol, and intents, discovery and transports.",
